#. module: website_sale
#: model:ir.model.constraint,message:website_sale.constraint_product_stock_notification_rel_product_stock_notificat_a3552ee5
msgid ""
"A stock notification can only exist once per product, website and partner."
msgstr "ການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສະຕັອກສາມາດມີໄດ້ພຽງຄັ້ງດຽວຕໍ່ໜຶ່ງສິນຄ້າ, ເວັບໄຊ ແລະ ຄູ່ຄ້າ."

#. module: website_sale
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:website_sale.s_donation_form
msgid "A year of cultural awakening."
